From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Eduardo Ruiz <335073+eduarbo@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 19:02:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Pause a grid's slideshows under the screen saver and skip
 captures that do not load

The system view did not pass the screen saver on to its grid, so the
selected item's slideshow kept decoding a capture every few seconds under it.
The view now forwards screen saver on and off to the grid and its items. A
slideshow also stops while the view is hidden (a game list, a game).

A next capture that does not load (a file that is gone or not an image, a
texture evicted or dropped from the load queue) was waited for forever. It
is now asked for once more a second past the interval, and two seconds later
the following capture is tried instead; with nothing else to show, the
slideshow keeps its capture and tries again every interval.

The timing lives in SlideLayout::Clock, free of ES types so it can be tested
alone.
